  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      46.8,
      67.92,
      567.55,
      191.4
    ],
    "text": "Promise.lk is Sri Lanka\u2019s national electronic Government Procurement (e-GP) platform. Government Procurement Entities (PEs) can conduct shopping goods procurements as e-Procurements which the bidders can submit online bids to a secure system and publish procurement notices and award details of all other procurements online through this platform. It currently supports procurements up to LKR 25 million for local funding and up to LKR 35 million for foreign funding within the applicable procurement framework. LKR 25 Mn (MPC \u2013 GOSL Funding)",
